/separation.py:11:The fixed recipe (docs/stem-separation-plan.md, \"Separation recipe\"):\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:24:Two invariants this module exists to guarantee (docs/stem-separation-plan.md\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:82:class SplitSpec:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:107:def spec_hash(spec: SplitSpec) -> str:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:114:    spec: SplitSpec\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:131:            spec=SplitSpec(stem=\"vocals\", source_role=\"original\", keep=(\"stem\", \"back\")),\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:137:            spec=SplitSpec(stem=\"bass\", source_role=\"original\", keep=(\"stem\",)),\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:143:            spec=SplitSpec(stem=\"drum\", source_role=\"original\", keep=(\"stem\",)),\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:149:            spec=SplitSpec(stem=guitar_stem, source_role=\"original\", keep=(\"stem\",)),\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:155:            spec=SplitSpec(stem=guitar_stem, source_role=\"instrumental\", keep=(\"back\",)),\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:164:    \"\"\"What a `Separator` hands back after a successful split. `outputs` maps\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:175:class Separator(Protocol):\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:194:        spec: SplitSpec,\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:201:class FakeSeparatorError(RuntimeError):\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:205:class FakeSeparator:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:211:    `FakeSeparatorError` instead of completing, letting tests assert that a\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:236:            raise FakeSeparatorError(f\"injected failure at {point!r}\")\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:242:        spec: SplitSpec,\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:279:def _content_seed(source: Path, spec: SplitSpec, side: str) -> int:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:281:    the requested side, so `FakeSeparator`'s otherwise-fabricated output is\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:308:    bytes at the same path must never reuse someone else's stems.\"\"\"\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:336:def stems_dir(project_path: Path, namespace: str) -> Path:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:337:    return artifact_namespace_dir(project_path, namespace) / \"stems\"\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:401:    backend: Separator,\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:409:    stems = sidecar[\"analysis\"][\"stems\"]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:410:    operations = stems[\"operations\"]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:411:    artifacts = stems[\"artifacts\"]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:455:    work_dir = stems_dir(project_path, namespace) / \"_work\" / op_def.operation_id\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:470:                final_path = stems_dir(project_path, namespace) / ARTIFACT_FILENAMES[artifact_name]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:507:    backend: Separator,\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:522:    `--force-stems` split, which is CLI-layer (issue C)).\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:538:    stems = sidecar[\"analysis\"][\"stems\"]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:539:    resolved_guitar_type = guitar_type or stems.get(\"guitar_type\") or \"electric\"\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:542:    stems[\"guitar_type\"] = resolved_guitar_type\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:543:    stems[\"backend\"] = backend.name\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:544:    stems[\"api_version\"] = backend.api_version\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:545:    stems[\"recipe_version\"] = RECIPE_VERSION\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:546:    namespace = stems.get(\"artifact_namespace\") or _generate_namespace(project_path)\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:547:    stems[\"artifact_namespace\"] = namespace\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:557:        stems[\"operations\"].setdefault(operation_id, _empty_operation_record(recipe[operation_id]))\nsrc/vgt/separation.py:567:            instrumental = stems[\"artifacts\"].get(\"instrumental\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
